  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#930\">任意灯笼！</span></strong></span><br>本模组新增了 <strong>9</strong> 种具有独特模型和趣味小特性的灯笼。<br>后续版本将支持更多灯具类型及与其他模组的整合。<br><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/090f107a9769499def44e2b532823e94.png\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/ebb7b971673d6833ca28631a0b850dd3.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/090f107a9769499def44e2b532823e94.png\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><br><strong>更多截图：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/33c061931b644436179d90012df60158.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\">参与模组共创！你可以将自己的灯笼加入此模组。加入 Discord 社区发送你的灯笼作品，即可获取制作模板。</span></pre>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> 此外，欢迎提交你的建筑作品，它们将被收录至模组画廊中。</span></pre>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/0b66ce3133c9dbcf77fbd8bb3e9a7176.png\" width=\"678\" height=\"339\"><br><br></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://bisecthosting.com/RPGSMW\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 使用优惠码 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://bisecthosting.com/RPGSMW\" rel=\"nofollow\">RPGSMW</a>&nbsp;首购立减 25%！</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><br></span><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/090f107a9769499def44e2b532823e94.png\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ZcETyCwHxV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/3ecf9dd3ff97576f8640833966810a56.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br><br></span></p>",
